            "title": "Horniman Museum, Forest Hill, London",
            "summary": "Looking for an alternative to chocolate bunnies &amp; daffodils on the Easter break&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>Looking for an alternative to chocolate bunnies &amp; daffodils on the Easter break myself and a friend headed up to the curious <a title=\"Horniman Museum and Gardens\" href=\"http://www.horniman.ac.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"st\"><em>Horniman Museum</em></span></a><span class=\"st\"> in Forest Hill, London, in search of some ‘<em>unusually persevered’</em> feathered friends…</span></p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\"  data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/37/gallery/HORNIMAN-MUSEUM-1.webp\" data-size=\"1024x768\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/37/gallery/HORNIMAN-MUSEUM-1-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/37/gallery/HORNIMAN-MUSEUM-1-2.webp\" data-size=\"768x1024\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/37/gallery/HORNIMAN-MUSEUM-1-2-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/37/gallery/HORNIMAN-MUSEUM-1-3.webp\" data-size=\"1024x768\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/37/gallery/HORNIMAN-MUSEUM-1-3-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/37/gallery/HORNIMAN-MUSEUM-1-4.webp\" data-size=\"768x1024\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/37/gallery/HORNIMAN-MUSEUM-1-4-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a></figu