            "id": "https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/cosmonauts-birth-of-the-space-age-at-the-science-museum/",
            "url": "https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/cosmonauts-birth-of-the-space-age-at-the-science-museum/",
            "title": "Cosmonauts: Birth of the Space Age at The Science Museum",
            "summary": "With the advent of the first British ESA astronaut to set foot&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>With the advent of the first British ESA astronaut to set foot in space, Tim Peake, there’s never been a better time to tell the space story from it’s beginning days and that’s just what the Science Museum new exhibition has done. I’ve always heard about America boasting about their great conquests but I didn’t know that Russia had already accomplished so much in getting out the atmosphere ~ the world’s first artificial satellite, Sputnik in 1957, the first dogs to survive a space flight in 1951, the first man in space, Yuri Gagarin in 1961 (in an incredibly small pod device your see in the photos) and the first woman in space, Valentina Tereshkova 1963, then a three manned pod in 1964 and in 1965 Alexei Leonov was the first person to walk in space for 12 minutes.</p>\n<p>All this before man went to the Moon in <span class=\"_Tgc\">1969 by the Americans <span class=\"st\" data-hveid=\"49\">Apollo 11</span>, without Russia’s vital contribution I don’t think any country would have achieved what they have in space history today. Cosmonauts: Birth of the Space Age is on at the Science Museum until 13th March 2016 and although it’s a ticketed event, £12.60, it’s worth seeing these historic space items in the flesh, and whilst walking around the exhibition you get a genuine feeling of actually how tiny we all are in this place they call the universe!</span></p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\"  data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1.webp\" data-size=\"1024x752\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"564\"></a>\n<figcaption>Cosmonauts - Birth of the Space Age at The Science Museum</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-2.webp\" data-size=\"768x1024\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-2-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a>\n<figcaption>Entrance to the exhibition</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-3.webp\" data-size=\"1024x685\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-3-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"514\"></a>\n<figcaption>Konstantin Yuon’s ‘New Planet’ painting, 1921</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-4.webp\" data-size=\"849x1024\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-4-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"926\"></a>\n<figcaption>Huttlepod for the “flying city” by Georgii Krutikov</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-5.webp\" data-size=\"1024x579\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-5-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"434\"></a>\n<figcaption>Konstantin Tsiolkovsky’s first space rocket design</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-6.webp\" data-size=\"498x1024\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-6-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"498\" height=\"1024\"></a>\n<figcaption>Sergei Korolev, Chief Designer of the Soviet space programme</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-7.webp\" data-size=\"768x1024\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-7-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a>\n<figcaption>Sputnik kettle design</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-8.webp\" data-size=\"1024x768\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-8-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>Sputnik, beep...beep...beep… The Soviet space race</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-9.webp\" data-size=\"768x1024\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-9-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a>\n<figcaption>Solar cell panel from Sputnik 3. The Soviet space race</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-10.webp\" data-size=\"768x1024\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-10-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a>\n<figcaption>Luna 9, launch date 1966. The Soviet space race</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-11.webp\" data-size=\"768x1024\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-11-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a>\n<figcaption>Luna 16, launch date 1970. The Soviet space race</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-12.webp\" data-size=\"768x1024\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-12-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a>\n<figcaption>Sputnik 3, launch date 1958. The Soviet space race</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-13.webp\" data-size=\"768x1024\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-13-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a>\n<figcaption>Вehepa -7. The Soviet space race</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-14.webp\" data-size=\"337x1024\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-14-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"337\" height=\"1024\"></a>\n<figcaption>Space dogs story, 1957. The Soviet space race</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-15.webp\" data-size=\"768x1024\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-15-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a>\n<figcaption>Space dog space suit. The Soviet space race</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-16.webp\" data-size=\"768x1024\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-16-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a>\n<figcaption>Fitted hold and helmet for a space dog. The Soviet space race</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-17.webp\" data-size=\"1024x1024\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-17-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"768\"></a>\n<figcaption>Astronaut’s chair. The Soviet space race</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-18.webp\" data-size=\"1024x771\"><img src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-extras/media/posts/36/gallery/COSMONAUTS-BIRTH-OF-THE-SPACE-AGE-1-18-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"578\"></a>\n<figcaption>Space rocket technical equipment. The Soviet space race</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io